flowchart TD
  CL[assistant claim] --> EX[extract_claims]
  EX --> EV[evidence.json claims]
  EV --> VC[validate_codebase]
  VC --> PR{paths in claim?}
  PR -->|none| UNV[validation_status=unverified]
  PR -->|exist on disk| VAL[validation_status=passed]
  PR -->|missing on disk| FAIL[validation_status=failed]
  UNV --> GAP[gap: claim-not-validated]
  FAIL --> GAP2[gap: claim-contradicted severity=high]
  VAL --> OK[no gap]
